OL,3,GNEWSACouncil launches one-stop support
OL,4,Aservice
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn online service is being launched to
OL,7,Fhelp residents find advice and support
OL,8,Fin one place.
OL,10,FThe Here to Help AI tool, developed by
OL,11,FPeterborough City Council, aims to give
OL,12,Fpeople a single place to start when
OL,13,Fthey do not know which service or
OL,14,Forganisation to approach first.
OL,16,FThe council said Here to Help could
OL,17,Fassist with a wide range of issues,
OL,18,Fincluding money worries, housing,
OL,19,Floneliness, caring responsibilities,
OL,20,Fwork and health, family support and
OL,21,Fpractical help in the community.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
